WEBVTT

00:35:29.163 --> 00:35:32.079
the potential with general artificial
intelligence of

00:35:32.079 --> 00:35:36.454
a sort of runaway effect of
self-improvement that can happen far

00:35:36.454 --> 00:35:39.704
faster than any kind of humans
can even keep up with,

00:35:39.704 --> 00:35:42.913
so that the day after you get to ajai,

00:35:42.954 --> 00:35:48.079
suddenly computers are thousands
of times more advanced than us

00:35:48.079 --> 00:35:53.496
and we have no way of controlling
what they do with that power.

00:35:54.788 --> 00:35:57.163
Yeah, and that is certainly
in the risk space,

00:35:57.288 --> 00:36:03.079
which is that we build this thing and
at some point somewhat suddenly,